<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="styles/_house.css">
<style>
.root { gap: 28px; }
.flowstrip { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--ink2); border-top: 1px solid var(--line); padding-top: 14px; }
.card.code .d { font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 13.5px; color: var(--code); }
.card.code { background: var(--elevated); }
.cardlogo { height: 24px; opacity: 0.85; margin-left: 12px; }
</style>
<style>@page { size: 900,00pt 645,00pt; margin: 0 }</style></head>
<body>
<h1>GraphRAG pipeline - from triples to validated multi-hop answers</h1>

<div class="col root"><div class="row"><div class="card"><div class="t">Documents</div><div class="d">text · manuals · charts</div></div>
<div class="arrow">&#8594;</div>
<div class="card blue"><div class="t">Entity/Relation Extraction</div><div class="d">constraint-based</div>
<div class="d">bound to ontology classes</div>
<div class="d">(Metformin) -[treats]-&gt; (Diabetes)</div></div>
<div class="arrow">&#8594;</div>
<div class="card green"><div class="t">Knowledge Graph</div><div class="d">nodes + typed edges</div>
<div class="d">semantic enrichment</div></div>
<div class="arrow">&#8594;</div>
<div class="card blue"><div class="t">Leiden Communities</div><div class="d">cluster + summarize</div>
<div class="d">per abstraction level</div></div></div>
<div class="row"><div class="card green"><div class="t">Local Search</div><div class="d">multi-hop walk</div>
<div class="d">path-validated</div></div>
<div class="card blue"><div class="t">Global Search</div><div class="d">cluster summaries</div>
<div class="d">corpus-wide Qs</div></div></div>
<div class="row"><div class="card blue"><div class="t">Grounded, explainable answer</div><div class="d">retrieval path = evidence trail</div></div></div>
<div class="row"><div class="card"><div class="t">Without ontology: agent walks impossible paths</div><div class="d">with ontology: constraint extraction + path validation</div>
<div class="d">→ no invalid conclusions</div></div></div>
<div class="card"><div class="d">adapted from Microsoft GraphRAG repository documentation (MIT)</div></div></div>
<div class="flowstrip"><div>Leiden Communities &#8594; Local Search</div>
<div>Leiden Communities &#8594; Global Search</div>
<div>Local Search &#8594; Grounded, explainable answer</div>
<div>Global Search &#8594; Grounded, explainable answer</div></div>

</body>
</html>
